Text: En- sembling often improves the quality of the generated translations drastically. How- ever, it is not suitable for production sys- tems because it is cumbersome and slow. This work aims to reduce the runtime to be on par with a single system without com- promising the translation quality. First, we show that the ensemble can be unfolded into a single large neural network which imitates the output of the ensemble sys- tem.

